   "gloss": "What do you do for a living?",
   "note": "The chapter teaches you to state a profession but never to ask about one — there is no question form anywhere in it. This is the polite, neutral way. Ce faceți? is shorter and also common, but it can also just mean 'what are you doing right now', so this one is safer.",
