   "id": "s131",
   "type": "narration",
   "lang": "en",
   "voice": "en_narrator",
   "text": "So: în România, la București. The country takes în, the city takes la. And la medic means at the doctor's — you went there to be seen, not merely to stand inside the building.",
   "rate": 1.0,
   "pause_after_ms": 1000
